    wwrbtr = - lv_wrbtr .
    wqsshb = - lv_wt_qsshh .
    wqbshb = - lv_wt_qbshh .
*<=== (MOD)   JLRA (RUBIOA2) - CORRECCIÓN - 02.07.2026 (END) <===

  ENDIF.

*     Net amount with respect to WT base
  wqsfbt = wdmbtr - wqsshb.

*     Net amount with respect to VAT tax
