        APPEND X_WITH_ITEM.
      ENDLOOP.


*   Determine total WT amount with posting at invoice time

*   In the case that there are WT types with posting at invoice, the
*   invoice amount in bsik (bsak) does not correspond to the total
*   amount but is reduced by the total WT amount of all types with
*   posting at invoice time. Thus, it is necessary first to loop over
*   the with_item and to detect and to sum up all WT amount of posting
*   at invoice types.
    PERFORM GET_TOTAL_WT_AT_INVOICE TABLES X_WITH_ITEM
                                           X_T059P
                                           X_WT_AT_INVOICE
